#ASSERT `Is my business grouped with the other business` `as the employer` `Jarrah and the practice, excluded by the Commissioner` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Is my business grouped with the other business` `as the employer` `Jarrah and a related body corporate, excluded by notice` EQUALS yes
