#ASSERT `What is the upper threshold amount` `as the employer` EQUALS amount `the upper threshold amount`
-- Pay-roll Tax Act s 5: 5.5% for 2031-32; 5.75% on $200 million in 2021-22 (the sliding scale, FORMULA).
#ASSERT `What payroll tax rate applies to my assessment year` `as the employer` 2032 285600 1 EQUALS `the answer is` `5.5 per cent`
#ASSERT `What payroll tax rate applies to my assessment year` `as the agent` 2022 200000000 1 EQUALS `the answer is` (`a sliding scale rate` 5.75)
#ASSERT `What payroll tax rate applies to my assessment year` `as the employer` 2022 3000000000 1 EQUALS `the answer is` (`What is my payroll tax rate` 2022 3000000000 1)

§§ `For a local nongroup employer`

-- s 11A(1): the annual threshold for d044's full year is $1,000,000; for 30 days of June 2031, $1,000,000 x 30 / 365;
-- for 73 days, $200,000. Not for an interstate nongroup employer or a group member: nothing else is read.
