#ASSERT (`How much payroll tax must my business pay for the year` `as the employer` `local nongroup` `Jarrah grown to $1,650,000 of wages in 2034-35` EQUALS `tax of` 41250) AND (`How much payroll tax must my business pay for the year` `as the agent` `local nongroup` `Jarrah grown to $1,650,000 of wages in 2034-35` EQUALS `tax of` 41250)
#ASSERT (`How much of this payment counts as wages` `as the employer` `Jarrah as employment agent pays a placed worker` EQUALS amount 10000) AND (`How much of what I pay a placed worker is wages paid by me` `as the agent` TRUE 10000 0 EQUALS `wages paid by you as the employer` 10000)
